# Pairs with TypeOK. A model-domain defect: the budget leaves 0..MaxWrites.
MODULE: AddOverrunsTheWriteBudget
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a facade add consumes two writes, driving the write budget below zero
PERTURBS: AddEntry

--- FIND
    /\ slots' = [slots EXCEPT ![x][e] = MergeSlot(@, Slot(TRUE, clock[s] + 1))]
    /\ clock' = [clock EXCEPT ![s] = @ + 1]
    /\ budget' = budget - 1
--- REPLACE
    /\ slots' = [slots EXCEPT ![x][e] = MergeSlot(@, Slot(TRUE, clock[s] + 1))]
    /\ clock' = [clock EXCEPT ![s] = @ + 1]
    /\ budget' = budget - 2
--- END